## Dimension 3: Security

### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorization Required — filing endpoint requires valid JWT with filing role scope
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption — filing requests over TLS 1.2+

### Security Requirements
- Filing scoped to authenticated user's practice; cross-practice filing not permitted
- Document ERN generated server-side using UUID v4; not user-supplied
- OCR/AI suggestion endpoint (when enabled) does not expose raw document content to third-party services without appropriate DPA in place

