### Interaction Patterns

**AI suggestion disclosure:**
- Hint appears on every OCR/AI-suggested field; not removable by admin
- On field change: hint remains (disclosure persists regardless of whether admin changed the value)

**Mandatory field validation:**
- Triggered on "File document →" click; not on blur (reduce interruption)
- First validation error: focus moves to first error field; error summary at top of panel

**Confidentiality + Visibility defaults:**
- Both default to most restrictive option on form load
- Changing either value shows `Banner variant="warning"` inline: "You have changed a fail-closed default. Ensure this is clinically appropriate."

